    "directions": [
      "In a bowl, add chicken keema, red chilli powder, ginger garlic paste, green chilli.",
      "Add onion, carrots, salt to taste, soy sauce and mix them together and roll them into even sized balls.",
      "Roll the chicken balls over rice and place them in a greased steamer vessel to steam them in a closed container for 15-20 minutes.",
      "After steaming, leave it for 5 minutes to allow the rice to rise. And then plate it with chilli tomato or schezwan sauce."
    ],
